{
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The property would be not suitable for conversion to a House in Multiple Occupation as the original floor space would be less than 130 square metres and would not be located within an area with good access to public transportation and convenient walking distance of town centre facilities. The proposal is therefore unacceptable in principle, contrary to Local Plan policy SC10 and the Houses in Multiple Occupation SPG.",
    "Reason : 2 - The application has failed to demonstrate that the proposal would not result in increased disturbance to residents of neighbouring properties contrary to Local Plan policy SC10 and the Houses in Multiple Occupation SPG.",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposal would fail to provide a sufficient standard of accommodation for future occupiers by virtue of the cramped and inadequate internal and external space. The proposal is therefore contrary to Local Plan policies SC5 and SC10 and the Houses in Multiple Occupation SPD.",
    "Reason : 4 - The application has failed to demonstrate that the proposal would have an acceptable impact on the local highway and not result in additional excessive parking stress on the roads surrounding the development. The proposed development is therefore contrary to Local Plan policy EC2.",
    "Reason : 5 - The proposed development would fail to provide adequate access to cycle parking facilities for occupiers, failing to sufficiently promote sustainable modes of transport, and would therefore fail to comply with Local Plan policy EC2 and London Plan policy T5."
  ],
